<title>DENMARK: Hypotekbanken raises 4pct bond by 200 mln DKK.</title>
<headline>Hypotekbanken raises 4pct bond by 200 mln DKK.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's Hypotekbanken has increased an existing four percent bond by 200 million crowns to 1.7 billion crowns, arranger Gudme Raaschou said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The bonds, maturing in 2002, were already sold, it added.</p>
<p>--Ole Mikkelsen, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
